# Local IDE login

GET `http://localhost:3000/api/dev/login?email=` mints an Auth.js session.
`email` is required and must match `DEV_LOGIN_EMAIL`. Fail closed (404)
unless `next dev` on localhost. Implementation notes:
[docs/dev-login.md](../../../docs/dev-login.md).
